- Supporting: `struct Inline {glyphs, urls, boxed}` at `:195-202`; `SHOWN` mask (`BOLD|ITALIC|CODE|STRIKE|LINK|TAG|HIGHLIGHT|UNDER|KEYWORD|STRING|NUMBER`) at `:247-257`; `tame()` at `:217`, `draw_line()` at `:389`, `text_rows()`/`Rows::lines()` callers (e.g. quote path `:814`).
- Full body (how links/images render, where `urls` added, defs fallthrough):

```rust
fn inline(line: &str, from: usize, font: Font) -> Inline {
    let flags = md::flags(line, from);
    let mut hidden: Vec<bool> = flags.iter().map(|f| f & md::DIM != 0).collect();
    let mut link = vec![None; line.len()];
    let mut out = Inline::default();
    for (r, l) in md::links(line).into_iter().filter(|(r, _)| r.start >= from) {
        match l {
            // `[[Note|alias]]` shows its alias.
            Link::Wiki(_) => {
                if let Some(bar) = line[r.start + 2..r.end - 2].find('|') {
                    hidden[r.start + 2..=r.start + 2 + bar].fill(true);
                }
            }
            Link::Url(url) => {
                link[r].fill(Some(out.urls.len()));
                out.urls.push(url);
            }
            Link::Tag(_) => {}
        }
    }
    let mut mark = vec![0u8; line.len()];
    for (r, color) in md::highlights(&line[from..], false) {
        mark[from + r.start..from + r.end].fill(color as u8);
    }
    let symbols = md::symbols(line, from, &flags);
    let mut i = from;
    while i < line.len() {
        let shown = out.glyphs.len();
        let next = if let Some((_, len, sign)) = symbols.iter().find(|s| s.0 == i) {
            out.push_str(sign, flags[i] & SHOWN, link[i], font);
            i + len
        } else {
            let c = line[i..].chars().next().unwrap_or(' ');
            if !hidden[i] {
                let c = if c == '\t' { ' ' } else { c };
                out.glyphs.push(Glyph {
                    c,
                    style: flags[i] & SHOWN,
                    link: link[i],
                    w: advance(c, flags[i] & SHOWN, font),
                    mark: 0,
                });
            }
            i + c.len_utf8()
        };
        out.glyphs[shown..]
            .iter_mut()
            .for_each(|g| g.mark = mark[i]);
        i = next;
    }
    out.boxed = tame(&mut out.glyphs, font);
    out
}
```
- How defs would print: no footnote branch — `[^a]`/`[^a]:` are not `Link::Wiki/Url/Tag`, not `DIM`, not `symbols`, so they fall to literal `Glyph` path and print in place. `urls` only grows on `Link::Url`; `draw_line()` (`:389`) later turns `glyph.link` into clickable `links.push(([x,y,w,h], urls[l]))`. Images/embeds handled one level up in `Rows::note()/embed()` via `md::image()`, not in `inline()`.

